Rule 8 (UninitializedParameter indexing will always give zero)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : int} |= v_1[v_2] = 0
>>
Rule 9 (UninitializedParameter + int will always give the int)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : int} |= v_1 + v_2 = v_2
>>
Rule 10 (UninitializedParameter * int will always be zero)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : int} |= v_1 * v_2 = 0
>>
Rule 11 (UninitializedParameter / int will always be zero)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : int} |= v_1 / v_2 = 0
>>
